 "text": "Hi, how you doing right now? Try drawing the eyebrows on first, then the eyes in the same direction so they match. Try it on a practice face. Halfway is about right for most people, especially women. The nose should start little below the middle of the face and angle down and out. Have fun with it. Simple faces drawn quickly can sometimes look more interesting than ones you spend lot of time on.",
